MUSelection [SimTalk]
Sets how the Source designated by <Path> selects the MUs to be produced.
Remarks
Depending on the setting that you enter, the attribute Path either sets the path to the delivery list, the
sequence table, the frequency table, or the MU class.
To use a copy of the DataTable instead of a reference to the DataTable, assign the name .unshare to the
subtable.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.MUSelection:string
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
You can specify "Constant", "Sequence Cyclical", "Sequence", "Random", "Percentage", or "Order
Controlled".
Example
MySource.MUSelection := "Sequence"
SimTalk
