Path [SimTalk] - Source
Sets the path to the delivery list, the sequence table, the frequency table, or the MU class of the Source
designated by <Path>.
Remarks
What the path relates to depends on the settings for TimeOfGeneration and MUSelection:
Note
The Source does not produce parts whose time of creation is in the future when you assign a Delivery
Table during the simulation.
